# Supa Maven Skin

**Supa Maven Skin** is a modern [Apache Maven Site](https://maven.apache.org/plugins/maven-site-plugin/) skin inspired by Pradyun Gedam's [Furo](https://pradyunsg.me/furo/) Sphinx documentation theme and built on **Bootstrap 6 (`${project.properties.getProperty("bootstrap.version")}`)**, **Bootstrap Icons**, **Vite**, **Dart Sass (SCSS)**, and **TypeScript**.

> [!NOTE]
> This documentation site is rendered using **Supa Maven Skin** itself! Try toggling between **Light**, **Dark**, and **Auto** themes or switching accessible color schemes in the top utility bar, or pressing `/` (<kbd>⌘K</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+K</kbd>) to open the search dialog.

